    "《地球新主》需要获取您的位置来显示您在末日世界中的坐标，帮助您探索和圈定领地。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Earth Lord needs access to your location to display your coordinates in the post-apocalyptic world and help you explore and claim territories."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld" : {

    },
